+    // [cannon][A16] MTK legacy IMS does not register on cold boot because the framework pushes the
+    // IMS capability config before MTK's carrier-config/ImsConfig subsystem is ready. Replay the
+    // proven-good manual "VoLTE off->on" toggle a little after carrier config is loaded.
+    private static final int BOOT_VOLTE_REAPPLY_DELAY_MS = 12000;      // wait before first replay
+    // MTK 实测在 BOOT_COMPLETED 前(≈开机+13s)就已就绪，45s 余量过剩；12s 足够，慢开机靠 3 次重试兜底。
